window.products.push({"id":914007,"name":"MAZFORCE LongHaul Lunch Bag Insulated Lunch Box - Spacious Pro Performance Adult Lunchbox Built to Withstand your Daily Grind (Lunch Bags Designed in ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816XCNMf6FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"MORE POWER. MORE LUNCHBOX - This design elevates an iconic style with modern functionality and is built for office gladiator and weekend warrior in mind. We've made packing lunches more efficient with its built in Multi-Zone storage compartments to withstand your daily grind. KEEPING FOOD FRESH FOR THE LONG HAUL - What's inside is just important as what's outside. All MAZFORCE insulated lunch boxes are equipped with an ultra-thick, easy-to-clean, foam core and leakproof aluminum insulation - We put an end to leaky lunch boxes, spoiled sandwiches, and lukewarm drinks. ULTRA LIGHT AND BUILT FOR THE DAILY GRIND - It ultra light and we promise this insulated lunch box packs a mean punch. This lunch bag is designed with dual storage capabilities. The spacious main compartment can fit your larger lunch items. The elevated pouch compartment is well suited smaller food or drink items, so that you don't sacrifice an inch inside your lunch box for maximum efficiency. THINK OUTSIDE THE LUNCHBOX - We strive to bend the rules of functionality. This lunchbox is equipped with an adjustable shoulder strap and hands-free buckle handle which allows you to attach our lunch bags to your backpack, gym bag, or travel bag to keep up with your on-the-go-lifestyle. And don't forget to slip more of your necessities in the durable side mesh pockets and multi-zipper compartments. CONSTRUCTED TO WITHSTAND YOUR LIFESTYLE - For your safety, all insulated bags are made FREE from PVC, BPA, phthalate, and lead materials and have experienced rigorous quality control tests. Rest assured, you'll be equipped with family-safe, durable, eco-friendly materials including waterproof oxford fabric and leakproof aluminum inner lining to protect you from leaks or spills. If you are not 100% SATISFIED with this lunch box we will gladly offer a hassle-free refund or exchange.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/816XCNMf6FL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MAZFORCE","source_asin":"B07V7GQ7GR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914007","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07V7GQ7GR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07V7GQ7GR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914008,"name":"QLL 25oz Stainless Steel No Leaks Cocktail Shaker, Pro Mixing Good Solid Martini/Drink Shaker","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QlJZY0G6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"18/8 grade stainless steel cocktail shaker. How to use the QLL Cocktail Shaker Set to get the most out of it! Step 1 - Prepare your cocktail recipe from the included booklet. - Pour all the ingredients into the mixing section of the cocktail shaker, using the jigger. Step 2 - Add ice to the mixing section. - Ice is filled so that the mixing section is 2/3 to 3/4 full. Step 3 - Put the lid with the built-in strainer on top of the mixing section. - The small lid is placed on top of the strainer. Step 4 - Tap the top of the shaker with the palm of your hand to seal it tight. - Make sure its sealed well. Step 5 - Hold the shaker in both hands, with one hand on top and one supporting the base. - Shake well for 10 to 20 seconds. Step 6 - Remove the small lid and pour the drink through the strainer into a chilled cocktail glass and - Enjoy your cocktail!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51QlJZY0G6L._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"QLL","source_asin":"B078CXL89B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914008","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B078CXL89B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B078CXL89B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914009,"name":"Friendly Fumes Round Soy Candle Pillar 153-Peach-Jasmine Vanilla 2'' x 6.5'' (Inches)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31qAUdMw8VL._AC_.jpg","description":"Friendly Fumes soy pillar candles are individually hand poured with pure soy wax sourced from American soybean farmers, and real botanical oils. Soy pillar candles stand out from paraffin and other alternatives because soy wax burns cleaner and at a cooler temperature, making for a long-lasting burn that doesn't send a haze of soot and toxic chemicals into the air. Soy pillar candles can sometimes last twice as long as paraffin pillars.We put the same integrity into the wicks as we do in the wax. Our wicks are cored with sturdy hemp, never metal, and braided with U.S. grown, unbleached cotton. The quality of the wick matches the purity of the wax to extend the life of the candle, and diffuse fragrance through your home in a way that's strong, but never overwhelming. Choose your favorite scent from our \"scent library\" of almost 300 fragrances! You'll find florals, sweet citruses, woodsy musks and more. Our richly scented soy pillar candles add a touch of elegance to any room. Choose colors that compliment your décor, or go dye-free and unscented to create a warm, luxurious ambiance with no frills and no fuss. Our soy pillar candles burn clean, tunneling right down the center to avoid unwanted drips and spills. But if you do happen to spill a little hot soy wax, you can clean it up in a pinch with just a little soap and water. It's also easier to get out of carpets and upholstery than petroleum-based waxes. For the highest quality, purest soy pillar candles, you've come to the right place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31qAUdMw8VL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Friendly Fumes","source_asin":"B00DV02G8K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914009","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00DV02G8K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00DV02G8K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
