window.products.push({"id":914063,"name":"OverSoyed She Shed Candle Collection | Crayon Box Scent | Novelty Scented Jar Candle Artisan Hand Poured to Order | 8 oz. 75 HR Burn 2 7/8\" x 3 1/2\" R","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":15.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mT07zPDmS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Our best selling OverSoyed Original Man Cave Candles are beloved by our customers, but they often ask... Why isn't there a fun women's collection? We considered it for years, but worried that although harmless in intent, they may have come across as rude. But after consideration, we've decided to have some fun, and raise some funds for causes and worthwhile organizations that we care deeply about at the same time. Our OverSoyed Original She Shed Candles are perfect for that special woman in your life. Our Tumbler Candles are hand poured with our own blend of all natural sustainable soy wax. Each candle is highly scented with fun fragrances and are wicked with an eco-friendly cotton wick. Every candle is handcrafted to order in our new sexy, sleek, reusable glass tumbler. Purchase multiple candles and get a cocktail set free at the same time! Our hand poured all-natural soy luminaries make a great addition to any space. We take pride in our special formulation of 100% soy based wax, as well as our eco-friendly wicks and recycled packaging. Use our signature jar to decorate your living spaces or add a touch of class to party centerpieces. Fill your area with great fragrances which can transport you to exotic places all over the world, or relive a special moment in your life. Our candles also make a great hostess, birthday, wedding, and holiday gifts! And lastly, just because it's our \"She Shed\" line, doesn't mean you have to be a lady to enjoy our candles! OverSoyed is an equal opportunity company... just follow the product safety instructions!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51mT07zPDmS._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"OverSoyed","source_asin":"B094GDZMJH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914063","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B094GDZMJH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B094GDZMJH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
