window.products.push({"id":914065,"name":"Powerful Handheld Fabric Steamer Vardi FubSteam |Steam Clothing without Harming | Portable Hand Held Steamers | Risk Free Ironing Full Hot Vapor Power","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yPxkDAf5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Why a FubSteam? It takes just a quick glance, about three seconds, for someone to size you up when you meet them for the first time. In this short time, the other person forms an opinion about you based upon your appearance. Whether it’s a date or a job interview, a family event or a business meeting, the first impression you make creates your image in the eyes of others and all you can do after that is try to fix that impression. This is why it’s so important to do it right and look your best, to wear clean ironed clothes that you mix and match to express your style. However, in our busy lives today who has the time and the energy to iron every morning and deal with the ironing board. FubSteam will make your clothes look as if you stepped out of a Hollywood movie, where for every take a team of people works on your appearance and makes you look perfect. Remember! When you look successful, you also feel that way and you transmit it to the people around you. You’ll love the convenience of this compact handheld steamer. Its small size lets you go easily from one job to another and enables you to iron the smallest corners of complex fabrics such as the hidden corners of your drapery. This steam will never leak and spill water on your garments. Its nozzle head allows vapor to escape, while keeping drips away from your fabrics. Your clothes stay dry while you de-wrinkle them. Vardi has your family and home safety in mind. Never worry that you’ve left the steamer on. After 8 minutes without use it shuts itself off, returning to a safe mode, cold temperature until you’re ready to resume your work. Order Now We are committed to providing you excellence and satisfaction. If you are not happy with our product, we will refund 100% of your money. Order one for yourself and another one for a friend, and they won’t stop thanking you!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81yPxkDAf5L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VARDI FUBSTEAM","source_asin":"B01M2XZNDE","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914065","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01M2XZNDE","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01M2XZNDE","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914066,"name":"sbkj 2 PCS Acrylic Shoe Hanger Holder for Peloton Bike Hooks Shoes Holders Hanging Shoe Organizers for Matte Bike Accessories,Thanksgiving&Christmas G","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WFr8fpd+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This is a great accessory for storing shoes,especially if you have Peloton bike, I would recommend you to choose this shoe hook. Material: Acrylic material is durable and beautiful. Suitable for: Stable and safe Shoe Holder that can hold shoes of various sizes,you don’t have to worry about having no place to store your shoes. Style Match The black color shoe rack looks cooler and more dynamic,and perfectly matches the appearance of your Peloton exercise bike.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51WFr8fpd+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"sbkj","source_asin":"B08KCYGHHJ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914066","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08KCYGHHJ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08KCYGHHJ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914067,"name":"Wooden Boxes with Hinged Lids - Alexander, Set of 2: Decorative Storage Trunks, Antique Wood Chests, Wooden Treasure Chests, Wood Boxes for Organizing","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":70.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IPv3badDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Introducing the Alexander set of 2 wooden boxes with hinged lids - the perfect combination of style, function, and elegance. These decorative storage trunks not only provide an attractive way to organize your belongings but also serve as a beautiful accent piece for any room in your home. Crafted from high-quality materials, these wooden boxes feature a rich finish, faux leather straps, and vintage-style hardware, giving them a timeless appeal that complements various decor styles. The sturdy metal handles on the sides ensure easy transportation, making these trunks versatile and practical for a range of storage needs. Ideal for decluttering your space, the Alexander wooden boxes can be used to organize books, magazines, small electronics, and more. They're also perfect for storing clothing, arts and crafts, letters, or office electronics. The set includes two different sizes, offering a variety of storage possibilities: Large measures 13.7\" x 8.6\" x 7.1\", and Small measures 11\" x 6.3\" x 5.3\". These wooden boxes can be displayed individually on a shelf, stacked beside a sofa or chair for a decorative touch, or used beneath a glass coffee table. They're also great for college dorms, holding everything from books and toiletries to important documents and snacks. The Alexander set of 2 wooden boxes makes a thoughtful gift for family members or friends. Fill them with treasured items, such as vintage linens, jewelry, or family photographs, and pass down cherished heirlooms in a beautiful, meaningful way. Ideal for travelers, these wooden boxes can also hold maps, postcards, or souvenirs, making them a unique and memorable housewarming gift. Add a touch of sophistication and practicality to your home with the Alexander set of 2 wooden boxes with hinged lids. Invest in these beautiful storage trunks and experience the elegance and functionality they bring to your space.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81IPv3badDL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SLPR","source_asin":"B07DFM1RS2","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914067","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07DFM1RS2","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07DFM1RS2","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914068,"name":"Pfaltzgraff Mason Jar Tealight Holder in Metal Caddy (15-Inch, Multicolor)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CkrAAS5EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"This Pfaltzgraff 4-Tealight Assorted Color Mason Caddy is a fun way to add a splash of color to your decor while introducing candlelight to your living space. This mason jar caddy holds four glass tealight mason jars in various colors. The metal wire frame caddy has a black finish and a handle for carrying. Add traditional ambience to any room. The caddy measures 14. 69 x 5. 51 x 5. 91 inches. For use with tealights only. Tealight candles are not included; sold separately.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81CkrAAS5EL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pfaltzgraff","source_asin":"B00IJZ5W8I","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914068","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00IJZ5W8I","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00IJZ5W8I","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914069,"name":"Stainless Steel Circle Tension Shower Curtain Rod | Easily Adjusts 45-78 Inches | Fits Most Standard Showers | Heavy Duty Design | Corrosion and Rust ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UERvwKezL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"NO DRILLING, NO TOOLS, NO HOLES IN THE WALLS! INSTRUCTIONS INCLUDED WITH EACH UNIT! The simple twist to extend design of this tension shower curtain rod allows you to easily adjust it to fit in any shower space or bathtub area. With a counter clockwise twist of the right side, this rod can extend from 45 inches to 78 inches. A clockwise twist will lock the rod back in place to stay put exactly where you want it. No holes in the walls. The tightness can then be adjusted with the fine tune adjuster on the end stop. No difficult drilling and loud tools necessary. HIGH QUALITY, LONG LASTING MATERIALS This rod is made from a high grade stainless steel, which means it comes with a beautiful glossy finish. This quality material gives this rod necessary properties to allow it to last, such as rust resistance and anti-corrosion. The white end stops won't damage your walls and give the rod enough friction (more friction equals less slipping; for example, icy roads have very low friction) to hold up even the most heavy-duty shower curtains. Don't let these high quality, multi-use rods slip out of your hands. Only a limited number of units remain! IMPORTANT : There have been some units delivered that are malfunctioning due to carrier mishandling during shipping. This can be fixed by screwing off the end stop of the smaller rod, then twisting loose the actual rod itself before extending. The end stop can then be screwed back on and the rod can now be used as intended. If it has been damaged to the point that this does not fix it, contact us and we will replace your unit for you.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51UERvwKezL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The C.H.O.","source_asin":"B074TMPNCZ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914069","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B074TMPNCZ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B074TMPNCZ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
