window.products.push({"id":914072,"name":"Individual Cupcake Containers - BPA-Free Plastic Holders for Standard Cupcakes - Stackable Carrier Cups - Clear Single Boxes - Cupcake To Go Container","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KS9tx1o0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"INSPIRE MOUTHWATERING GOODNESS AT FIRST GLIMPSE Black forest or butterscotch, peanut butter fudge or triple salted caramel, our cupcake packaging allows you to crown your indulgent creations with a touch of convenience. No need to look further for your cupcake supplies as we promise you the best quality. You’ve got better things to think about - like ensuring everyone will go weak in the knees once they bite into your blackberry coconut cupcakes! Our cupcake holders are designed to showcase your best creations. The true beauty of our single cupcake holder cups? They can hold both standard and jumbo-size cupcakes! Just flip them over whenever you’ve whipped up those jumbo servings of scrumptiousness and display them in compliment-sparking style. PRODUCT SPECIFICATIONS: ✔ Includes: 50 Single Clear Containers ✔ Container Material: BPA-Free Plastic ✔ Colors: Clear Containers ✔ Container Size: 3.9” x 4.3” x 3.6” Inches NO MORE DEALING WITH SMOOSHED FROSTING As bakers ourselves, we know just how much care it takes to create that perfect swirl; just how much care it takes to position that chocolate chip. So, while most cupcake boxes ruin the frosting when closed, ours have a deep dome to accommodate it. And the design of our cupcake carriers gets even more thoughtful! The containers have finger indentations for mess-free removal, enough room at the top for a logo or thank you note, and a stackable design to save space during transit. So, whether you’re looking to beautifully display cupcakes at your bakery, want to be swarmed with customers at that bake sale, or plan to surprise loved ones with lip-smacking deliciousness, you’ll have the cupcake storage to match. Happy baking!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81KS9tx1o0S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B09247SCVV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914072","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09247SCVV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09247SCVV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
