window.products.push({"id":914092,"name":"Greheywos 10 inch cordless folding fan / floor fan, 90-Degree Automatic oscillating, Adjustable in height and angle, 4 kinds of wind speed adjustment,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JCy6hjWNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[Height and Angles Adjustable & Automatic oscillation] Unique design incorporates height, angle and oscillating adjustment, Height freely adjustable between 4.9\" ~ 38.3\", 180 degree adjustable head tilt angle and 90 degree adjustable left and right oscillating head. This fan can be used as a desktop fan, a floor fan or pedestal fan... to provide you with more choices of different heights and angles, near and far, high and low - just to make you feel comfortable [Wireless & Portable] Vertical fan uses 7200mAh high-capacity lithium battery, Long battery life (1st gear:16h/+oscillating 8h) (2nd gear:8h/+oscillating 4h) (3rd gear:4h/+oscillating 3h). USB Type-C and battery power supply is safer. It takes 4 hours to be fully charged. The wireless design makes it convenient to use, without the constraints of the power cord, moving at any time, so that you can stay away from the summer humidity and heat and keep freshness and coolness company [Remote Control + Timing Function] Within 5 meters of the fan, you can remotely control the fan switch, with 4 kinds of wind speed adjustment, oscillating head, and timing function. You can give operation commands without getting close to the fan, which saves you from the trouble of walking and bending over. [Noise-free & Powerful Wind] The combination of air volume and aerodynamics, together with five silent fan blades design, cuts air more evenly. It's noise-free and has bigger but gentler air volume, 4 kins of wind speeds (breeze/soft wind/strong wind/breeze strong wind circulation). Specifically, strong wind mode can quickly cool down the temperature and bring you coolness, while breeze mode allows you to enjoy a quiet and comfortable sleeping, studying or working environment. [Foldable for easy carrying and storage] Innovative folding design with 10 inch diameter after folding. Easy to store, put in backpack or drawer, & perfect for bedroom, living room, kitchen, garden, office, classroom, camping, travel, fishing, etc. The bottom of the base is designed with non-slip silicone pads to make the fan more stable, and the front grille is removable for cleaning, so that you can enjoy healthy and fresh natural breeze at all times!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61JCy6hjWNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Greheywos","source_asin":"B09QPJJ9V8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914092","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09QPJJ9V8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09QPJJ9V8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
