window.products.push({"id":914328,"name":"Scented Candles for Home, Soy Candle in Tin Jar for Home Decor Made with Soy Wax and Essential Oils, Floral Shop Scent, 6oz. (Gifts for Women, Mothers","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IPw3p-CQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Inexpensive candles are usually made of paraffin, which when heated, emits substances that can cause allergies. The fragrance is often too cloying and intrusive and can literally \"suffocate\" a small space.  Our candles are made from soy wax using a quality perfume fragrance, as in perfume compositions. They melt evenly and fill the home with a delicate fragrance for a long time.  So instead of buying a few cheap sencted candles, it's better to splurge on a higher quality product. When choosing a soy candles for home, you should consider two key factors: where exactly you plan to put it and what atmosphere you want to create.  For example, in the bedroom, you should choose a calmer composition, which will help you relax and improve the quality of sleep. In a bathroom, on the contrary, you can put a candle with a bright citrus or mint note to make waking up in the morning easier.  You can also be guided by the seasons: in winter we often want spicy and pine scents, and in spring - floral and fresh.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71IPw3p-CQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"IQTRAVELS","source_asin":"B09NY2Z13D","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09NY2Z13D","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09NY2Z13D","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
