window.products.push({"id":914348,"name":"Monster MP PRO 5100 12-Outlet Power Center with Stage 4 Clean Power (Discontinued by Manufacturer)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31QMXA4XZAL._AC_.jpg","description":"From the Manufacturer PRO 5100 Professional Rack Mountable PowerCenter™ featuring Patented Monster® Clean Power™ Stage 4 with Five Separate Isolation Filter Sections, Exclusive T2™ Automatic Shutdown Circuitry, and Surge Protection for Ultra-High Performance The PRO 5100 PowerCenter™ for Audio Professionals who Demand Advanced Protection and Performance Combining an advanced level of patented Clean Power™ noise filters with the protection your equipment needs to be prepared for whatever local power conditions may deliver, the PRO 5100 is bursting with features that also make work slightly easier for the sound professional: Rack handles for easy moving, a rear panel XLR light for hassle-free installation and wiring, a 2-line red LED display, removable feet for easy stacking and a snug fit with any 19-inch EIA-standard rack mount shelf. Plus, we use a heavy-duty, double shielded PowerLine™ 300 power cable with extra-long 8-foot length. But of course, it's the legendary patented Clean Power filtering technology and patented Tri-Mode protection that make the 5100 the choice of pros. Without Clean Power, Your Audio System Can’t Deliver Peak Performance Many so-called “power conditioners” only protect against random power surges and/or voltage spikes. But, in fact, AC power line noise and noise generated by other components are equally harmful and constant threats to performance. These disturbances can cause inferior sound quality marred with lower bandwidth and reduced signal-to-noise ratio. Additionally, many power conditioners’ outlets often can’t handle the peak transient current capacity that high power amplifiers demand. As a result, dynamic distortion and loss of peak power can occur, preventing your amplifiers from ever maximizing their performance. The filtering of radio frequency (RF) and electromagnetic (EM) interference can remove much of the extraneous noise from your system for the best possible sound from your audio components. Clean Power Stage 4 goes further, by isolating different types of audio equipment from each other, so that noise generated by motors and high frequency digital signals won't introduce noise into other components. Five ultra-advanced isolated filters enable your analog components to perform with stunning clarity, expanded frequency response, and powerfully precise imaging, while your digital components--Digital Multitrack, Digital Connectors, MiniDisc, Digital Signal Processor or Recorder--will deliver clearer, sharper sound. High current audio outlets, specially designed for power amplifiers, will deliver the instantaneous peak currents needed to avoid distortion and keep drums sounding crisp, even at loud listening levels. Microprocessor-Controlled Sequenced Switching and High-Capacity Surge Protection Ensure Enhanced Safety for Your Expensive Audio Components The PRO 5100 features intelligent, microprocessor-controlled turn-on sequencing to protect your components from damage that may occur when they're powered on in an incorrect sequence. The unit also provides superior surge/spike protection for your components with Monster Tri-Mode circuitry and a surge/spike absorption capacity of 3145 Joules. In addition to 12 surge-protected rear panel AC outlets and 2 front panel convenience outlets, the PRO 5100 also features surge-protected RJ45/RJ11 network/phone combo connectors for protection from phone line and LAN surges, and coax protection for cable-TV or similar lines (especially useful for broadband connectivity). Digital microprocessor-driven voltmeter and amp meter provide instantaneous monitoring of power conditions and fluctuations. For added protection, the exclusive Monster T2 Circuitry will auto-reset after most AC surge events--the system automatically recovers, and signals you that a problem occurred. It all adds up to superior pro-grade protection you can really rely on for your equipment, and performance maximizing award-winning power conditioning that's world-renowned. Stop worrying about surges wiping you out, and stop power line noise cold. Get PRO 5100 for your audio system, and focus on the music.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31QMXA4XZAL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Monster","source_asin":"B000EOWA6O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914348","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000EOWA6O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000EOWA6O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
