window.products.push({"id":914463,"name":"Nagina International Handmade Contemporary Beautifully Crafted Genuine Premium Wall Decor & Functional Time's Clock with Vintage Roman Dial Face | Pre","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":79.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EnK2My4DL._AC_SL1382_.jpg","description":"Remain In Pace With Time, By Using Contemporary Wall Clocks Worthy Of Every Dime. Our Clocks Come In Styles, Designs, And Colors That Will Go Well With Room Interiors And Walls Of All Type. A One-Stop-Shop For Home Decor And Furniture, Nagina International Sells A Variety Of Home Products. We Understand The Importance Of Timeless Art. Each And Every Product Designed By Us Is Inspired By Some Uniqueness And Then Converted Into Masterpiece By Relentless Passion. In Today's Changing World, Home Decor Is Incomplete Without Home Accessories E.G. Wall Clocks, Wall Decor & Wall Accessories And Understanding The Importance Of Today's Home Decor Concept, We Launched An Exciting Range Of Designer Wall Clocks, Wall Decor & Designer Wall Accessories With Most Latest And Contemporary Designs To Suit Your Home Interior Needs. The Contrasting Colors Interplay To Create A Riot That's Elegant And Eye Catching. Wall Clocks Are More Than Just Time-Showing Devices. This Wall Clock Makes Beautiful Home Decor Item. Just Add A Stunning Wall Clock To Your Wall And Watch The Wall Transform Into A Beautiful Piece Of Art. Crafted From High-Quality Wood, This Clock Is Designed To Last Long And Is Easy To Clean And Maintain. Gift Your Loved Ones This Wall Clock To Make Their Celebrations Memorable. This Decorative Wall Clock Has Been Diligently Handcrafted By Proficient Artisans Using Various Traditional Techniques.Keep Exploring Nagina International As We Have Everything For Everyone.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81EnK2My4DL._AC_SL1382_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nagina International","source_asin":"B072Q668C7","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914463","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072Q668C7","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072Q668C7","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914464,"name":"White Block Tile B0US4130 Garage Flooring Interlocking Tiles Coin Pattern","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mYrn60LVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"These durable interlocking floor tiles are designed to provide an attractive and practical garage flooring solution. The tiles come in various colors so that multi-colored designs can be created. The tiles feature a beautiful coin solid top shape with a grid underneath that allows air and water passage. The tiles are comprised of a high-impact polymer, which is a rigid, lightweight and strong material. They are able to withstand the high rollover weight of large vehicles including SUVs and pickup trucks. The rigidity and strength of the polymer from which the tiles are constructed allow for the tiles to be designed with a grid on the underside of the tiles. The grid design allows air and water flow. Other types of garage flooring available in the market, such as rubber flooring or flexible PVC flooring, lack the grid design feature due to material constraints. Installation of these tiles is very simple as no special tools are required. They interlock together with a loop-to-peg system to create a \"floating floor.” So when installing the floor, it is important to leave a 1/2-Inch gap minimum around permanent objects. Due to differences resulting from various digital devices, please note that color represented on your monitor may differ slightly from the actual interlocking floor tiles. If you are uncertain of the color or construction of the tiles, please ask for a free swatch sample to be sent to you free of charge by contacting the Manufacturer's Customer Service Department at 1.877.595.2040.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81mYrn60LVL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BlockTile","source_asin":"B009RI6DV6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914464","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B009RI6DV6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B009RI6DV6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
