window.products.push({"id":914509,"name":"DEILSY 4-Tier Skirt Hanger 3PK Skirt Hangers with Clips Space-Saving Tiered Skirt Hangers with Adjustable Clips Cascading Clothing Hangers for Skirts,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z0W+zo6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"DEILSY focuses on delivering a wide range of storage & organization solutions meant to transform your home into a fresh, well-organized living space without sacrificing safety and comfort. Using ingenious designs and top-quality materials, we are able to provide amazing products that combine functionality and aesthetics to make your everyday life easier! If you experience any problems with your order, keep in mind that our friendly customer care department is always ready to answer your questions and resolve any issues or concerns!  Organize Your Skirts and Clothing Much Easier with Our 4-Tier Skirt Hanger!  The skirt hanger with clip will make a valuable addition to your closet that allows you to store and organize your clothes more conveniently and prevent creasing! The 4-tier design expands the storage space vertically and makes more room for other clothes while the adjustable clips ensure a stronghold and prevent your skirts or clothing from falling. Simple and practical, this hanger for closet is an excellent choice to keep your favorite skirts, dresses, pants or jeans at hand while your closet will look neat and well-organized!  Still not convinced? Here are some of the amazing features of this product:  4-tier skirt hanger with clips; Adjustable clips can accommodate any clothing piece; Heavy-duty metal construction; Can hold up to 15lbs; Rubber coated tips to prevent damages; Welded tiers for enhanced resistance; Keeps the clothes neatly folded without creases; Easy grip clips; Ideal for skirts, pants, shorts, dresses, scarves, men’s and women’s trousers, and other clothing pieces; Reduce clutter and helps organize the closet; Space-saving; Convenient set of 3 hangers;  Upgrade your closet organization and storage with our 4-tier skirt hangers!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81z0W+zo6cL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DEILSY","source_asin":"B0BL23GPXD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BL23GPXD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BL23GPXD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
