window.products.push({"id":914730,"name":"Personalized Grandma Blanket Throw. Reasons I Love Being a Grandpa Grandma Papa Mommy Nana. Customized Blanket for Grandparent with All Names in for B","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":84.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LeVWAc70L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","description":"Personalized Name Blankets for Grandma, Grandpa, Papa, Mommy, Nana. Custom Name Blanket from Your Family Member's Names. Reasons I love being a Grandpa, Grandma, Papa, Mommy... Gift for Grandparents day, Mothers day, Fathers day, Christmas, Thanksgiving day. Include your title and up to 30 names can be included in this Name Blanket. Include your title and up to 30 names can be included in this Name Blanket. If less than 30 names are filled in, some of the names entered will repeat to complete this blanket name design. If less than 30 names are filled in, some of the names entered will repeat to complete this blanket name design. You want: A great way to commemorate special events and priceless moments such as Grandparents day, Wedding Gifts, birthdays, showers, graduations, holidays gift, Mother Day's Gift, Father Day's Gift, Thanksgiving gift, Christmas gift, proms, and much more. You need: A personalized custom blankets super soft. This Throw Blanket is an all season must-have. The blanket will be custom printed with a choice of color option and the inside will hold up to 30 names in the different fonts. Using the latest in printing and production technology. This Grandparent blanket is made from durable, premium fabric, machine washable and tumble dry low. The color will not fade even after many washes. You desire: FAST DELIVERY. Your customized gift will be prepared in USA and quickly shipped. You get: Everything you want, need and desire with this personalized name blankets with your customized names. 100% Satisfaction. Your satisfaction is our ultimate goal. If you have any question, just click on the \" Contact Seller \" button or leave your question into \" Customer Questions & Answers \".","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61LeVWAc70L._AC_SL1100_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Yeh Gift","source_asin":"B07TF5BJFM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914730","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07TF5BJFM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07TF5BJFM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914731,"name":"NAO Winged Friend","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":125.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31EB02V7D7L._AC_.jpg","description":"Product Description Nao porcelain sculptures are hand crafted in Valencia, Spain where pioneers in the European porcelain industry have been creating timeless works of art since the company's inception in 1953. This blend of old-world craftsmanship and the latest ceramic technology ensures that each individual Nao sculpture is finished to perfection and will be cherished for generations to come. Nao's extensive collection of more than 300 sculptures captures the unforgettable moments of life including motherhood, weddings, childhood, falling in love, the joy of pets, the beauty of nature, religion and much more. Both gift-givers and discriminating collectors alike will appreciate the quality and attention to detail that signifies each and every Nao sculpture. Nao, part of the Lladro group, is sold in more than 122 countries around the world. Amazon.com Nao porcelain figurines express the joys, tender moments, and important passages of life. Hand-crafted by skilled artisans and hand-painted in soft pastel shades, each Nao sculpture makes a cherished heirloom and is sure to delight the recipient. Winged Friend, standing approximately 7-1/2 inches tall, shows a girl whose long hair and skirt are blowing in the breeze, while a white dove rests peacefully on her outstretched hand. Imbued with serenity and grace, the piece makes a sweet gift for a loved one on almost any occasion. Nao figurines are made in the studios of its renowned parent company, Lladró, in Valencia, Spain. A blend of skilled craftsmanship and state-of-the-art technology goes into each piece, which is kiln-fired for more than 20 hours to ensure a flawless final glaze. The collection of approximately three hundred figurines includes angels, children, pets, mermaids, wedding cake toppers, religious icons, and more. Collectors eagerly await the new arrivals each year. --Ann Bieri","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31EB02V7D7L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NAO","source_asin":"B000HQ90WG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914731","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000HQ90WG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000HQ90WG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
