window.products.push({"id":914733,"name":"BLACK+DECKER 1.32 Gallon Ultrasonic Warm & Cool Mist Humidifier","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":53.97,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619kFiFy3NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Our BLACK+DECKER humidifier provides dry air relief for soothing comfort with the added benefit of aromatherapy. Fill your room with your favorite essential oils while enjoying the humidifier’s cool mist. This ultrasonic humidifier has a 1.32 gallon/5L water tank capacity and offers a continuous run time of 28 hours per filling on minimum speed. This cool mist humidifier is great for rooms up to 550 square feet. This diffuser humidifier also features a touch panel control for ease of use. Our air humidifier has a 360-degree rotational mist outlet to direct mist where you need it. Auto shut off when tank is empty. Water level indicator. Molded plastic housing. Includes 59” power cord with 2-prong/Type A plug. 30 watts. Includes one Ceramic Infused filter. Measures 7.6” x 7.6” x 11.57”. Weighs 3.81 lbs. UL listed.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619kFiFy3NL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BLACK+DECKER","source_asin":"B0983C5SN8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914733","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0983C5SN8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0983C5SN8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914734,"name":"Warebest Stoneware Salad Plate Set of 4 (7-Inch, 4-Piece), Vibrant Spanish/Mexican Floral Design Porcelain Dessert Plates","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FsvtkRpZL._AC_.jpg","description":"7-Inch, 4-Piece Ceramic Salad Plate SetStoneware Teal Blue Lunch/Dessert Plates Service for 4 We are Direct Manufacturer and specialized in variouskinds of stoneware/dolomite/porcelain ceramic dinnerwareDinnerware is one of those home essentials you don't think too much about until you need a new set. Then, when you do, it can be overwhelming to decide between materials, patterns, size, shape, and number of place settings. If you want a quality dinnerware set that will last you years to come, you can choose our four types of tableware. (LIke this : B07CFWV2SM, B07Q28JQN3, B07PRXP387, B07PN2FNYN) Traditionally, formal dinnerware sets were for entertaining, whereas casual dinnerware sets were for daily use. Today, it's uncommon to have separate formal and casual dinnerware, We mainly sell and produce daily casual dinnerware. Dinnerware set materials Dinnerware sets can be found in a range of materials, but the three most common are stoneware, porcelain, and bone china.----We use an economical and beautiful stoneware material.Stoneware dinnerware tends to be found in a wider range of colors, usually with bolder options and various glazes, both shiny and matte.  Stoneware Stoneware is a type of ceramic made from unrefined clay fired at a very high temperature. It's thicker and sturdier than porcelain and bone china. Pros: Fairly strong and chip-resistant, can be finished with a with a wide range of glazes in various colors and textures, generally dishwasher safe and microwavable, more affordable than fine china. Size Size matters when choosing a dinnerware set. We recommend measuring the depth and width of the cupboard in which you intend to keep your dinnerware.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61FsvtkRpZL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Warebest","source_asin":"B07PQ5RQZY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914734","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07PQ5RQZY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07PQ5RQZY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914735,"name":"ufengke 11 Piece Creative European Luxury Tea Set, Ivory Porcelain Ceramic Coffee Set With Metal Holder, Hand Painted Red And White Rose Flower, For W","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.14,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oauYR4yiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"About Ceramics -China China,as one of the world's most ancient civilizations,it is fair to say that ceramics history is a very important part of China's history.The word \"china\" clearly shows that the country is the \"home\" of pottery and porcelain. There are many varieties of porcelain tea sets,the main ones are: celadon tea set,white porcelain tea set,black porcelain tea set and colored porcelain.These tea sets have had a glorious page in the history of Chinese tea culture. Special Collection Function Tea set collection has existed since ancient times.It can not only realize the function of making tea, but also can be used as home decoration.At the same time, it also has certain value-added space.Under the economic conditions,many tea friends are willing to collect a few pieces of tea sets that they like.There are many kinds of tea sets for collection,and the more popular ones are porcelain tea sets and Zisha tea sets. Use & Maintenance This tea set is resistant to high temperature,wear-resistant,not easy to fade. When use the tea sets at the first time,put the teapot into clean pot with cold water and boiling for about 5-10 minutes.Then remove the pot from the boiling water and set aside for natural cooling.This step can make tea sets more clean and safety. Tea sets are pure hand-painted crafts.Available for disinfection cabinet,dishwasher and microwave oven if the tea set without colorful pattern.Not recommend to use in microwave ovens or dishwasher if the tea set with colorful pattern. There are some small flaws in the production, such as small black spots,small bubbles and so on,it's inevitable because of firing technology .  Anyone who likes to drink tea with tea sets will love what ufengke offers.So start enjoying low tea/high tea.Click \"Add to Basket\" to get one today!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91oauYR4yiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ufengke","source_asin":"B01KV1M924","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914735","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01KV1M924","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01KV1M924","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
