window.products.push({"id":914822,"name":"GOONE Comforter Set,Ultra Soft Hypoallergenic Stone Washed Microfiber 3 Pieced Quilt,Allover Stitching and Embroidery, Twin,Queen and King Set in Soli","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JRYfMvYYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"ABOUT OUR QUILT SETS -COMFORTAABLE AND MULTIPURPOSE MATERIAL: The Quilt set is made by heavy stone washed poly microfiber fabrics, pre-washed again after finished, the fabric is super friendly to your skin.. The Quilt filled with hydrophillic down alternative, Which is light weight, warm, silky and breathable puffy and more of a high loft quilt feeling. Why Choose Hydrophillic Down Fill? The revolutionary technology of high fill power and down fiber provides extra fluffiness to get the most invigorating sleep. The ability to float in water makes the comforter extremely comfortable, moisture absorbent and easy to maintain. SIZES AVAILABLE : We Have King Queen/Full Twin Size Quilt sets available MULTIPURPOSE: This quilt sets can be as s bedspread and thin Comforter,coverlet. MONEY BACK WITOUT 100% SATISFIED 1.Money back if you are not 100% satisfied,We are US native company, we can offer the Timely service 2.Could You Do Us a Favor? When you find the item you received is damaged or broken ,or not satisfied and want to return it，please kindly help to write \"Not Resalable\" or \"This Product Can Not Be Sold Again\" on the outer package. In case that Amazon deliver the damaged item to other buyer. It is done in order to make sure that every customer will get completely new products.Thanks a lot for your help. TIPS 1. Please allow 1-3cm error due to measurement. 2.Due to Different standard of the bedding set between different countries,please check the size before you place an order. 3. Due to differences in monitor settings, there may be a slight variation in color on screen,versus the actual material. 4. the comforter set comes in a highly protective vacuum,Once opened, we suggest for a quick fluff to revive comforter's original loft.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81JRYfMvYYL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GOONE","source_asin":"B089792XKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914822","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B089792XKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B089792XKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
