window.products.push({"id":914915,"name":"SkyColors Nail Wraps Real Polish Strips Solid Color 16 Sheets Sticker Nails Wrap Nail Decals Stickers Stick on Adhesive for Women with Nail File Girls","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K4kLfIn8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"REAL NAIL POLISH STRIPSWhat is included in package16 x sheets of solid color nail polish strips (12 pieces per sheet for total of 192 pieces)1 x nail filer1 x carton packageFeatures:1. Real nail polish strips and sealed to look nice2. Create your own style on the nail and enhance the beauty of your nails3. The package is easy to carry and store4. Perfect your nails with these wonderful nail decorations5. This makes a perfect gift for women of all ages6. Suitable for professional or home DIY useApplication Instructions:1.Make sure that your nails are clean and dry before applying any nail stickers.2.Use tweezers to lift and apply nail stickers to avoid touching adhesive with your fingers.3.Put the nail stickers very gently on the nails and press down when you are satisfied with the position.4.Smooth the nail sticker starting from the center to the edges to get rid of any air bubbles and even out the surface.5.Trim the edges of the sticker with the nail filer6.Apply light nail topcoat over the entire nail and stickers to seal the stickers.7.Avoid getting fingernails wet for at least 30 minutes after applicationAttention:1. To maximize the adhesive’s effectiveness, do not touch water for at least two hours. We recommend applying these nail strips at night.2. Leave a bit space between nails with cuticle, do not apply on cuticle or skin.3. The product can last longer if you use topcoat over the nail polish strips.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71K4kLfIn8S._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"SkyColors","source_asin":"B098TT4MLV","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914915","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B098TT4MLV","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B098TT4MLV","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914916,"name":"Projection Alarm Clock, Digital Clock 180° Rotatable Projector, Adjustable Brightness Dimmer, Clear LED Display with Temperature, USB Charging, 5 mins","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RCnNEldxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Easy to Use】: Based on customers' preferences and requirements, this projecting alarm clock for bedrooms has the functions that people use most, such as adjustable brightness, USB charging， 12/24H format transfer and snooze function. The simple operation of this digital clock makes it perfect for all ages. 【Simple Snooze Function】: Alarm clock uses a snooze button, so you can easily turn off the buzzer without getting up.The big snooze button helps you easily turn off the buzzer but don’t need to open your eyes and enjoy five minutes of sleep. The clock will alarm every 5 minutes until you turn off the snooze mode by pressing any other buttons. You can also set snooze time by yourself，1-60 minutes (settable) of extra sleep time, Perfect for heavy sleeper. 【Customize The Projection Postion】: The arm of this digital clock swivels 180 degrees for optimum positioning, getting the fine and smooth time figure image on the wall or ceiling at the appropriate distance of 1.64-11.4ft(0.5-3 meters). By long pressing the Projection Mode button, you can flip the orientation of upside-down projection images to convert the number right-side-up. 【 Power Saving Mode & Quiet Sleeping Function】: Unlike Mechanical alarm clock that keeps ticking, affecting the quality of your sleep.Electric clock is quiet, allowing you to get rid of the noise of the night and sleep peacefully. The user-friendly designed luminous function allows you to see the time clearly at night and does not need to turn on the lights. and you can use the night MODE, which can be automatically changed half brightness from 18 pm-6 am clock for avoiding damage to your eyes. 【Temperature Display & Time Memory Function】: Our alarm clock can display indoor temperature according to weather, the default showing way is the °C and you can adjust to °F by the down key.The normal measurement range is -10°C-50°C (14°F-122°F). When the external power supply is powered off, the hold time and various settings will be keeping.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61RCnNEldxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FULLBELL","source_asin":"B0B5G7CGSC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914916","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B5G7CGSC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B5G7CGSC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
