window.products.push({"id":914971,"name":"Bamboo Mattress Protector with Zipper - 100% Waterproof Queen Size Cooling Mattress Cover - Ultra Soft Jacquard Fabric Breathable Noiseless Mattress P","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":38.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZNa5CdDbL._AC_SL1499_.jpg","description":"Queen meausres 60 x 80 inch Perfect for any Mattress: Keep your expensive mattress in perfect condition! Our mattress protector is designed for all types of mattresses including latex, memory foam, and innerspring. Our zippered mattress protector comes with a zipper that zips around the entire mattress so that both top and bottom are covered, it's stretchable and secured by a protected zipper. WATERPROOF AND NOISELESS: Our waterproof mattress cover repels water and any type liquids including accidental spills and bodily fluids such as sweat or urine, which makes a clean/healthy sleeping environment. It's the Perfect choice for nursing sick kids, potty training and if you have pets in your home. It is also noiseless and makes zero sound. It is completely silent and makes no crinkling sound when you move on your bed! Ultra Soft Breathable Material: Our mattress toppers are made from the finest quality pure bamboo with a small combination of polyester to create the most durable and Ultra soft fabric that will always keep you comfortable. The bamboo surface is relatively more softer, smoother, and breathable. With the new bamboo cooling material technology, our mattress protectors provide a cooling effect that distributes heat evenly and regulates body temperature so you can have a cool sleeping environment. Easy Care Instructions - Our Mattress protectors are very easy to maintain. Machine wash cold separately on gentle/delicate cycle. Tumble dry on low. Do not bleach. Do not dry clean. We suggest you buy 2 pieces or more, so you can change one while washing the other. 100% GUARANTEED WARRANTY- We, at DreamField Linen have committed ourselves to provide all our customers with the most top quality products so you can have a comfortable and healthy life. However, if you are not completely satisfied for any reason, simply contact our customer support and we will do everything to make you 100% satisfied with your purchase.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71ZNa5CdDbL._AC_SL1499_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DreamField Linen","source_asin":"B0C4WZWVK6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914971","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C4WZWVK6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C4WZWVK6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914972,"name":"CORRURE 'Bride to Be' Sash for Bachelorette Party - Bridal Shower Black Glitter Sash with Multicolor Foil Lettering - Hen Party Decorations Supplies A","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":9.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81il4xXZn4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"❤️ HAVE A MEMORABLE CELEBRATION -- Surprise the bride with this beautiful bridal shower sash. Get the entire bride tribe into a festive mood and make wonderful memories that will last a lifetime. ✅ FOR THE STAND OUT BRIDE -- Make the bride-to-be stand out on her special day with this elegant bachelorette sash. Made from high quality glitter fabric and hand pressed Multicolor foil lettering. No missing letters, no spelling errors. ✅ FITS PERFECTLY -- Soft and comfortable to wear. Perfect size: measures 4 inches wide and 33 inches long. The bride can easily adjust the fit to her body. ✅ A NIGHT TO REMEMBER -- Unlike other cheaply made sashes, this gorgeous Black glitter sash with Multicolor foil lettering will complement any hen party theme. Instagram-friendly - will look good in any outfit! ✅ PREMIUM BRIDAL SHOWER ACCESSORIES -- Durable and reusable. Can withstand all the fun and craziness of the bride squad party. Upgrade the experience and combine this sash with other decorations like veil, crown, balloons, confetti, backdrop banner, cupcake toppers, photo props, tattoos, cake, and more. ✅ BACHELORETTE PARTY MUST HAVE -- Elegant and stylish. Does not wrinkle easily. It's a thoughtful keepsake that the bride will surely love. Check our store for other cool party favors supplies and games. ✅ CORRURE 100% HAPPY GOAL -- Our goal is to make all our customers enjoy the beautiful happy moments in life. We made thousands of customers happy so far but, if for any reason, you are not satisfied, get in touch with us and we promise to make it better or give you 100% refund. Press the \"Add to Cart\" button now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81il4xXZn4L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"CORRURE","source_asin":"B09GH981YK","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914972","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GH981YK","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GH981YK","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":914973,"name":"JML Bath Towels 2 Pack (27\"x54\"), Luxury Bamboo Bath Towel Set for Bathroom - Soft and Absorbent, Odor Resistant, Skin Friendly, Beige","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717ODApKXsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"What is bamboo fiber? Bamboo fiber is smooth and softer than the softest. It makes the most luxuriously gentle towels and face cloths that are marvellous for sensitive skin. Bamboo fibre is extremely absorbent and as soft as cashmere.  Natural Bamboo fiber has amazing qualities including a unique agent called “bamboo kun” which makes your Bamboo towels stay fresh between washes. Bamboo towels are ★Size: 27”x54”  ★kind to your skin ★super absorbent, absorbs moisture 3-4 times more than  ★quick to dry - dries twice as quickly as How should I care for a bamboo towel? ♥ Place your towels in a washing bag prior to its first laundering.  ♥ Launder towels with lukewarm water on delicate wash with like colors (do not add bleach) and thoroughly rinse.  ♥ Tumble dry no or low heat setting.  ♥ We do not recommend the use of fabric softeners as they tend to block the micro-gaps in the fibers leading to reduced absorbency.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/717ODApKXsL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"JML","source_asin":"B07D7231C9","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-914973","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07D7231C9","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07D7231C9","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
